## T1003 -- a record literal with a field its type does not declare.
## command: lume check   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; T1003_unknown_record_field.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: use the declared fields
type P = record x: int
fn p() = P{x: 1, z: 2}
print p().x
